{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o025a","title":"荀彧劝曹操暂缓九州改制先定河北","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o025a-account","label":"《荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十》正文","text":"荀彧劝曹操暂缓九州改制先定河北","evidence":["xunyu-e-o025a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0100","role":"进谏","evidence":["xunyu-e-o025a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"受谏","evidence":["xunyu-e-o025a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":204,"label":"建安九年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xunyu-y204","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xunyu-q-o024","basis":"建安九年"},"evidence":["xunyu-e-o025a-q","xunyu-q-o024","xunyu-q-b-1274098c4e3707963c03"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-o025a-q","source_order":[10,123,"O025a"],"order":2432}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0100","name":"荀彧","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o025a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-e9304a08562da9912d77","layer":"original","quote":"彧言曰：“若是，则冀州当得河东、冯翊、扶风、西河、幽、并之地〖8〗，所夺者众。前日公破袁尚〖9〗，擒审配，海内震骇；必人人自恐不得保其土地，守其兵众也。今使分属冀州，将皆动心〖10〗。且人多说关右诸将以闭关之计，今闻此，以为必以次见夺。一旦生变，虽有（善守）〔守善〕者，转相胁为非〖11〗；则袁尚得宽其死〖12〗，而袁谭怀贰，刘表遂保江、汉之间：天下未易图也。愿公急引兵，先定河北，然后修复旧京〖13〗，南临荆州，责贡之不入〖14〗；则天下咸知公意，人人自安；天下大定，乃议古制：此社稷长久之利也。”","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":250},{"id":"xunyu-q-b-1274098c4e3707963c03","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-1274098c4e3707963c03","layer":"modern","quote":"〖5〗九年：建安九年（公元 204）。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-05ec5dccb4a2549f7141","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"xunyu-q-o024","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-8f5617c1f161dca84cfc","layer":"original","quote":"九年〖5〗，太祖拔邺，领冀州牧。或说太祖：“宜复古，置九州〖6〗；则冀州所制者广大〖7〗，天下服矣。”太祖将从之。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":121,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
